<title>USA: TABLE-Calpine Corp sells $200 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Calpine Corp sells $200 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Calpine Corp was priced on Tuesday via lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Calpine acquires and operates power generation plants.</p>
<p>BORROWER CALPINE CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 8 3/4 PCT  MATURITY 7/15/07</p>
<p>TYPE SR NOTES	ISS PRICE 99.6353 FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD 8.805 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS  SPREAD +237.5     CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE FOR</p>
<p>							    FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1662))</p>
</text>
